# The one secret your store needs. The Deploy to Cloudflare button asks for it
# and saves it as a Worker secret; for local development copy this file to
# .dev.vars (never committed) and fill it in.
#
# Generate it with:   npx emdash secrets generate
# It encrypts the payment keys you enter in the admin. Keep a copy in your
# password manager: if it is lost, those keys must be entered again.
EMDASH_ENCRYPTION_KEY=
